Models
------
Models are downloaded at runtime (from Hugging Face; GigaAM — from its
authors' server) and are not distributed with this product; each is governed
by its own license:

* Speech recognition (GPU profile): bzikst/faster-whisper-large-v3-russian —
  a CTranslate2 conversion of antony66/whisper-large-v3-russian (a Russian
  fine-tune of OpenAI Whisper large-v3); Apache-2.0.
* Speech recognition (CPU profile, default): GigaAM v3 (v3_e2e_rnnt, and
  v3_e2e_ctc on request) by GigaChat Team — downloaded from the GigaAM authors'
  server into the application's models folder; MIT.
* Speech recognition (CPU profile, Whisper option): Systran/faster-whisper-medium —
  OpenAI Whisper medium in CTranslate2 format; MIT.
  (faster-whisper and CTranslate2 themselves are MIT-licensed.)
* Word timestamps (forced alignment):
  jonatasgrosman/wav2vec2-large-xlsr-53-russian — wav2vec2 XLSR-53
  fine-tuned for Russian; Apache-2.0.
* Speaker diarization and voice embeddings:
  pyannote/speaker-diarization-community-1 — CC-BY-4.0 (pyannote.audio code
  is MIT-licensed); requires accepting its terms of use on Hugging Face
  before download.

